lenges await after your first playthrough!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn 2D art and cute lighthearted characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full controller and native Steam Deck support.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Cubicorn Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/522290/bc007d797120106c945f10cd2430011c03ac3098/header.jpg?t=1752694236","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Steam OS<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 4000 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 4400<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 950 MB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/522290/861877/7ae17ee6504400672304a02b82f871f2eb4e5cef/1751297032/dash_av1.mpd?t=1743564883","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/522290/861877/7ae17ee6504400672304a02b82f871f2eb4e5cef/1751297032/dash_h264.mpd?t=1743564883","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/522290/861877/7ae17ee6504400672304a02b82f871f2eb4e5cef/1751297032/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1743564883","id":257121069,"name":"Gameplay Trailer (April 2025)","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257121069/07c686c984a53781f0f308e52d35d7f1b1b67278/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1743564883"}],"name":"Super Cucumber","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> WIndows 10 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 4000 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD 